<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>What radiance bright! The Word is God revealed to me,</l><l>Ent’ring as light—my path is clear, no more I’ll stray.</l><l>God’s Word contains life, truth, reality;</l><l>So open wide—God experience today!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>What sweet employ! The church life is my heart’s desire!</l><l>Eat, drink, enjoy! In me each day, more life divine.</l><l>Christ is supplied, increased; God’s house built; then</l><l>God’s glorified—on earth as in the heav’n.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
